/T (The system uses a layered client-server architecture. Student and Admin browser clients form the presentation layer. Django controllers expose REST endpoints and delegate rules to service components. The service layer contains authentication, exam management, attempt/navigation, submission/grading, and result-release logic. Data access is isolated behind Django ORM repositories over a relational database.)
/E (The system uses a layered client-server architecture. Student and Admin browser clients form the presentation layer. Django controllers expose REST endpoints and delegate rules to service components. The service layer contains authentication, exam management, attempt/navigation, submission/grading, and result-release logic. Data access is isolated behind Django ORM repositories over a relational database.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
